ot/pull/108189.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108189.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Previously, warnings were only output in the editor. However, users may pack a scene at runtime. If the configuration is wrong (for example, changing the owner of a node in a child scene), an error will occur when instantiating the new packed scene, but no warning will be output.\r\n\r\nClose #107921. \r\n\r\nWhen packing **in** the editor, it will check if there are duplicate nodepaths. This can be used to check for possible errors when packing the scene in the tool script.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108189/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108189/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}